  message: "Surfaced during the ADR-0039 R5 spec reconciliation. After naming_convention (WI-vakuh) and type_hierarchy (WI-botif) were seeded/derived, three inference pathways still emit a hardcoded confidence=1.0 that breaches the 0.95 reserved ceiling: build_dependency, subdir_include, tree_sitter. Same fix shape as naming_convention: seed a principled in-band base_confidence in _CONFIDENCE_SEEDS and drop the producer literal so Edge.create derives it (confidence_source=evidence_derived). Not part of the WI-lutad/WI-vakuh/WI-botif P1s; separate ceiling-breach cleanup."  # 48fa
